// Abilities: A0AI (Rescue), Researchubertip (Tooltip - Learn - Extended)
{
When this ability is used, it places a mark on an ally that instantly warns the War Guard when hes in danger.  When the targeted unit reaches 20% hp or lower, the War Guard will instantly be teleported to his ally.  In addition, the ally will become temporarily invulnerable for 5 seconds.  Very Long Range.  |n|n|cffffcc00Level 1|r - 90 sec cooldown |n|cffffcc00Level 2|r - 75 sec cooldown  |n|cffffcc00Level 3|r - 60 sec cooldown |n|cffffcc00Level 4|r - 40 sec cooldown, has an unlimited range.
}

