STRING 373
// Abilities: A0AI (Rescue), Ubertip (Tooltip - Normal - Extended)
{
Places a ward on an ally that activates when the ally reaches 20% life or lower, making him invincible for 5 seconds.  In addition, the War Guard is instantly teleported to that ally.  The ward lasts until discharged.  Only one target can be affected by Rescue at a time, but Rescue has an unlimited range.
}

