STRING 568
// Units: H00S (|cffff0000Earthen Templar|r), Ubertip (Tooltip - Extended)
{
"Bouldergravel" or "Earthdirt", are the closest translations for this strange creature's name.  Believed to have been summoned forth by a mage, this Earth Elemental has an unimaginable hatred for the invaders.. for reasons unknown.  The defenders of Vern aren't complaining, as long as he continues to obliterate their enemies with the power of Gaia herself! |n|cffffcc00Learns Stalagmite, Colossal Blow, Earthen Attunement, Gaia's Embrace, and Unstable Tectonics|r
}

