STRING 1906
{
You are the |cff32cd32Cleric of Order|r.  You are primarily a utility class, though you are adept at immobilizing enemies and healing allies.  Your usefulness comes not from powerful damage or great healing, but your ability to manipulate the battlefield to your advantage.
}

STRING 1907
{
You are the |cff32cd32Cleric of the Small Folk|r.  You are a versatile class, capable of both healing and battle.  Often, defeat is snatched away by your powerful blessing of luck.  When all looks lost, you are there with a lucky blow to bring down the enemy.
}

STRING 1908
{
You are the |cff32cd32Dwarven Axemaster|r.  You are a powerful melee unit, willing to get up in the thick of things and use your powerful abilities.  Manipulation of your limited mana pool to use your expensive but powerful abilities is vital!
}

STRING 1909
{
You are the |cff32cd32Monk of the Ebony Fist|r.  You are a versatile unit, able to deal melee damage, heal groups of units, and cause havoc with your abilities.  Using your abilities at the right times is the key to victory.
}

STRING 1910
{
You are the |cff32cd32Master of the Art|r.  You are a powerful spellcaster, capable of great damaging magic.  Though frail and weak, you are capable of spending great lengths of time blasting your enemy.
}

STRING 1911
{
You are the |cff32cd32Rogue of the Dark|r.  You are a stealthy individual, able to avoid trouble spots and assassinate individual units.  You are able to finish off wounded opponents quickly and efficiently, as well as cause confusion in enemy ranks.
}

STRING 1912
{
You are the |cff32cd32Feral Archon|r.  A creature from the nether planes, you are able to instanteously teleport around the map helping out.  Capable of great battle rages, you are a melee damage powerhouse.
}

STRING 1913
{
You are the |cff32cd32Human Engineer|r.  Not much of a fighter, your strength lies in your ability to build things.  You construct barriers to hold off the enemy, or powerful towers to discourage their attacks.
}

STRING 1914
{
You are the |cff32cd32Earthen Templar|r.  You are a melee powerhouse!  Though you attack slowly and move slowly, when you strike, the damage you deal is unmatched.  Your powerful control over the earth allows you to deal powerful earth damage.
}

STRING 1915
{
You are the |cff32cd32Man-at-Arms!|r.  A stalwart defender for hire, you are at the forefront of every battle.  Your eagerness to do battle serves you well, and you tend to level up much faster then other heroes.
}

STRING 1916
{
You are the |cff32cd32Sun Soul Initiate|r.  A mystical unit with a passion for battle, your mixture of melee and spell prowress always leaves enemies confused.  Master your melee and magic to become a powerful force.
}

STRING 1917
{
You are the |cff32cd32Paladin of Justice!|r.  A melee unit who adds support with his healing and conviction.  Undead fear you, and rightfully so.  With the blessing of your god, you fear no enemy.
}

