The cleric of Order realigns the cosmos.  Causes damage to all nearby enemies equal to half the difference between the cleric's current health and the enemy's current health.  Also slows all nearby enemies for a while.  Damage effect does not work on bosses.  3 minute cooldown.  |n|n|cffffcc00Level 1|r - Maximum Health loss of 25% per unit.  All enemies slowed by 40% for 6 seconds.  |n|cffffcc00Level 2|r - Maximum Health loss of 33% per unit.  All enemies slowed by 60% for 6 seconds.  |n|cffffcc00Level 3|r - Maximum Health loss of 50% per unit.  All enemies slowed by 80% for 6 seconds.
}

