STRING 2803
// Units: H003 (|cff7777aaCleric of the Small Folk|r), Ubertip (Tooltip - Extended)
{
Halflings are well-known for their love of fun, but few know of their loyalty to their friends in battle.  Nils comes from the Undershire, a halfling city allyed to the kingdom of Vern.  Armed with his trusty sling and the blessing of his goddess, he seeks to aid his ally in any way he can.  Able to fill in a niche in a party, Nils is a jack of all trades. |n|cffffcc00Learns Volley of Slingstones, Refresh, Unexpected Hero, Flip a Coin, and Divine Luck.|r
}

STRING 2804
// Units: E000 (|cff32cd32Monk of the Ebony Fist|r), Ubertip (Tooltip - Extended)
{
Venille follows a strict path of ritual.  He trains his will to be complete, his skill to be unmatched, and his power to be unsurmountable.  When the monestary in Vern comes under siege by the invaders, Venille goes forth to eliminate this "minor distraction".  Channeling energy known as "chakra", he is able to manipulate energy to make him as fast as quicksilver. |n|cffffcc00Learns Flurry of Blows, Chakra Burst, Crescendo of Blows, Blinding Speed, and Mass Image.|r
}

