// Units: H01M (|cffff0000Bovine Rockfighter|r), Ubertip (Tooltip - Extended)
{
Tordek's Clan is well-known throughout the land as "Bringers of War".  This is largely unfair, because they do not actively pursue war, just end them!  Tordek's arrival in Vern was seen as an Omen by the young tauren who quickly took up the cause of the beleaguered nation.  Leading charges, Tordek smashes through enemy formations as a powerful up-front warrior. |n|cffffcc00Learns Rampage, Last Stand, Dwarven Stamina, Intimidating Shout, and Earthcrack.|r
}

