// Units: H01N (|cff7777aaDisciple of Grace|r), Ubertip (Tooltip - Extended)
{
The high priestess of an order known only as "The Graceful", Faiya comes to Vern's Aid for reasons unknown.  Perhaps she is disgusted at the lack of grace shown by the invaders, or perhaps she has an agenda of her own.  Either way, her unearthly calm and demeanor is haunting to any who behold her.  Her skill as a support character cannot be questioned, however. |n|cffffcc00Learns Charm Person, Mass Recover, Sanctuary, Death Ward, and Epitome of Grace|r
