STRING 4036
// Units: E006 (|cff32cd32Axe Brother|r), Ubertip (Tooltip - Extended)
{
Faxanadu's skill with his weapon is unquestionable.  His ability to manipulate his weapon is almost supernatural.  Guiding warriors on their path to becoming champions, Faxanadu leads by example.  His presence on the battlefield means two things.  Its training time, and its time to kill! |n|cffffcc00Learns Whirlwind Attack, Berserker Frenzy, Decimate, Fang Strike, and Decapitate|r
}

