STRING 4038
// Units: H01U (|cff7777aaCentaur Druid|r), Ubertip (Tooltip - Extended)
{
Oakheart's home was the Forest of Sparrows, until the invading armies burned it to the ground.  Now, with nature's fury aiding him, Oakheart stands ready to unleash nature's judgement on those who would defile nature.  His abilities to conjure forth powerful treatnts makes him a popular choice for a party. |n|cffffcc00Learns Vine Whip, Summon Treant, Wispen Embrace, Explosive Vegetation, and Tree of Life.|r
}

