STRING 4040
// Units: H02C (|cff7777aaCleric of Elven Word|r), Ubertip (Tooltip - Extended)
{
Lyrra saw her lover slain before her very eyes by the riders of the Goblin King.  Vowing to save others from the tragedy she suffered, she joins Vern as a supportive spellcaster, able to mend the wounds of others as well as enhance their strength.  Her ability to fit in at any situation makes her a good choice for any party who needs a caster watching their back. |n|cffffcc00Learns Regrowth, Enchant Weapon, Blessing of Elven Word, Power Word: Stop, and Aura of Elven Ancestry.|r
}

