STRING 4746
// Units: O000 (|cffff0000Feral Archon|r), Ubertip (Tooltip - Extended)
{
Newten comes from a plane of existance know as the Happy Hunting Grounds, a plane that relishes in the perfection of a good hunt.  As a challenge, Newten agreed to hunt down the leader of Vern's invasion.  He certainly has his work cut out for him, but he's not complaining.  Newten boasts the ability to manipulate the planes and strike out ferociously to any who get in between him and his prey.  |n|cffffcc00Learns Savage Strike, Dimension Door, Trample, Tantrum, and Hunting Fervor.|r
}

