STRING 4749
// Units: H00F (|cff7777aaHuman Engineer|r), Ubertip (Tooltip - Extended)
{
Mustadio is the chief architect for Vern's capital city, and the thought of his beloved city burning to the ground is unthinkable.  Armed only with his trusty hammer, the engineer brings forth much needed respite for defenders in the form of various buildings.  Not much of a fighter himself, his structures can nevertheless turn a hopeless situation into a winnable one. |n|cffffcc00Learns Construction, Schematics, Repair, Marvel of Engineering, and Build Wonder.|r
}

