Paladeus's philosophy is simple one.  All souls are corrupted and must be purified by the heat of the sun.  Unfortunately for those he encounters, his methods often result in a torched skeleton left in the midday sun.  His skill in manipulating the sun's energy to his own ends make him a vital part of any team, but he must be wary not to accidently "purify" his own teammates!  |n|cffffcc00Learns Sunbeam, Sun Sear, Solar Barrier, Sol Strike, and Aurora Rays.|r
}

STRING 5107
// Units: H01J (|cffff0000Paladin of Justice|r), Propernames (Proper Names)
{
Haniel
}

STRING 5108
// Units: H01J (|cffff0000Paladin of Justice|r), Ubertip (Tooltip - Extended)
{
Haniel's parents were killed when he was but a young boy by a scourge of undead.  Rescued by a passing priest of Torm, Haniel took up the life of a paladin, upholding virtue and eliminating undeath wherever he found it.  Now, with rumors of undead preparing to besiege Vern, Haniel returns to his homeland to do battle and cleanse the source of undeath once and for all. |n|cffffcc00Learns Exorcise, Lay on Hands, Aura of Courage, Crusade, and Summon Angel.|r
}

STRING 5109
// Units: H01O (|cff7777aaArcane Archer|r), Propernames (Proper Names)
{
Azrae
}

STRING 5110
// Units: H01O (|cff7777aaArcane Archer|r), Ubertip (Tooltip - Extended)
{
Azrae learned her art from the Elven Academy of Mysticism.  Known for her sharp wit, charming personality, and good looks, Azrae's bow stands ready to blast her opponents with magical energy.  Her damage dealing abilities infuse magic with the bow, causing her to stand out as an outstanding damage-dealing hero. |n|cffffcc00Learns Eagle Arrow, Magic Shot, Far Shot, Volley-shot, and Multi-Shot Ward.|r
}

