STRING 5636
// Items: I0CD (|cff7777aaCrimson Cape|r), Ubertip (Tooltip - Extended)
{
|cff7777aaRare (Lv 1)|r - A crimson cape made from a questionable material.  When worn, grants +5% Life Steal and +2 to INT. |n|cffffcc00Leech Set (3 Piece Set)|r  |n|cffffcc00- Claw of the Vampyr Bat|r  |n|cffffcc00- Leech Tongue|r  |n|cffffcc00- Crimson Cape|r
}

STRING 5637
{
|cffd2691eTUTORIAL: During the course of the game, players who frequently support each other may establish a companionship.  Players who establish particularly strong companionships may unlock special character specific quests...|r
}

STRING 5638
{
|cffd2691eTUTORIAL: Companionships can also affect the story in a variety of ways, including character bondings, romances, and other features.  Companionships are only available in Story Mode.|r
}

STRING 5639
{
|cffd2691eTUTORIAL: Helping allies who are having trouble with their lanes is an integral part of the game.  Teamwork prevails!|r
}

STRING 5640
{
|cffd2691eTUTORIAL: By now, you should have a firm grasp of the game, as well as a healthy dose of gold!  Consider buying items to power your hero, or upgrades to help your team.  Gold cannot be traded, so purchase carefully!|r
}

STRING 5641
{
|cffd2691eTUTORIAL: Remember to help allies having trouble.  Only well-organized and supported teams will make it to the end.  The next level will be your first boss.  Remember to support each other and you should be alright!  Good luck, hero!|r
}

