{
You are the |cff32cd32War Guard!|r.  You are a hero who stoically holds the front line.  You are proficient in attracting enemy attention to yourself, buying time for allies to unleash their attacks.  Gear yourself accordingly, and Adomach will need hundreds to take you down.
