STRING 5924
// Units: H02X (|cffff0000War Guard|r), Ubertip (Tooltip - Extended)
{
Karl is part of the elite palace guard that Silmeria's father used to have.  After Vern came under siege, the palace guard was sent to the frontlines to aid the effort.  Giving their lives to buy the defenders time to act, only Karl came back alive.  Vowing to avenge his comrade's sacrifice, he stands fast in death's way. |n|cffffcc00Learns Aid Another, Shield Bash, Perfect Defense, Rescue, and Defender's Vow|r
}

