STRING 8089
{
|cffff0000Like a twisted plague, Adomach's army swept across the world.  Demoralized at the loss of their beloved princess, the last remnants of Vern's resistance crumbled within the month.|r
}

STRING 8090
{
|cffff0000In the end, Adomach's hold of the world grew strong.  Tragedy and despair was all the world would know, evermore..|r
}

STRING 8091
{
|cffff0000The deaths of so many innocent people took its toll on the kind Silmeria.  Blaming herself for being powerless to save them, she took ill.  Despite all of the heroes best efforts to cheer her, she never recovered.|r
}

STRING 8092
{
|cffff0000Left without a leader, panic ensued.  Many threw down their arms, or fled into the wilderness, never again to be seen.  With the anarchy, Adomach had little trouble taking over the kingdom, his first of his many, many conquests.|r
}

STRING 8094
{
|cffff0000With the caravan's destruction, Adomach's lackeys took opportunity of the confusion and stole the artifact.  Using Fell Magic, he perverted its true nature, creating an artifact of great evil.|r
}

STRING 8095
{
|cffff0000Drawing upon the artifact's perverted power, Adomach created a virulent plague and sent it into Vern.  Half the population fell within a week, including the Lady Silmeria.  Those who remained fought desperately, but in vain.|r
}

STRING 8096
{
|cffff0000With Vern conquered, Adomach turned to the south, using his new power to raise legions of plagued undead.  None could stand against his power, and a new reign of darkness began in the land.|r
}

STRING 8097
{
|cffff0000If you believe you are eligible for the leaderboards (Top 15 teams for each difficulty), take a screenshot of this screen and submit it to the forums listed below!|r
|cffff0000Official Forums: http://wc3destinybattle.freeforums.org|r
}

