// Units: H013 (|cffff0000Man-At-Arms|r), Ubertip (Tooltip - Extended)
{
Oscar's love of battle is matched only by his love of gold!  A mercenary for hire, Oscar finds himself trapped in the invasion of Vern.  With little choice to battle or die, he is hired by the princess to aid Vern in it's struggle.  Always on the forefront of the battle, Oscar is a war veteran and survivalist who can hold the line. |n|cffffcc00Learns Battle Shout, Stand Ground, Hired Wages, Battle Experience, and Cascader Strike|r
}

